cuidaogu:p004","text":"皇興初，顯祖詔征南大將軍慕容白曜固築長圍以守之。及白曜攻其城東郭，道固面縛請罪，表曰：「臣資生南境，限隔大化，本朝不以卑末，委授藩任。而劉氏蕭牆內侮，懼貽大戮，前遣崔啟之奉表歸誠，幸蒙陛下過垂矜納，并賜爵寵，慶佩罔極，應奔闕庭。但劉彧尋續遣使，恕臣百死。愚以世奉劉氏，深愆蒙宥，若猶違背，則是不忠於本朝，而欲求忠於大魏。雖曰希生，懼大魏之所不許。是用迷回，孤負天日，冒萬死之艱，固執拒守。僕臣白曜，振曜威靈，漸經二載，大將臨城，以今月十四日，臣東郭失守，於臣款彧之誠，庶可以彰於大魏矣。臣勢窮力屈，以十七日面縛請罪，白曜奉宣皇恩，恕臣生命。斯實陛下起臣死尸，肉臣朽骨，天地造物所不能行，而陛下育之。雖虞舜之貸有苗，姬文之宥崇壘，方之聖澤，未足以喻。既未奉朝旨，無由親馳道路，謹遣大息景徽，束骸歸闕，伏聽刑斧。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"慕容白曜","kind":"person","person_id":"bm0_pqc_ydf","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"白曜","kind":"person","person_id":"bm0_pqc_ydf","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"道固","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"崔啟之","kind":"person","person_id":"5jw_lta_ejc","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"劉彧","kind":"person","person_id":"cti_o52_4nz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0196","start":196,"end":198,"surface":"白曜","kind":"person","person_id":"bm0_pqc_ydf","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0230","start":230,"end":231,"surface":"彧","kind":"person","person_id":"cti_o52_4nz","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0258","start":258,"end":260,"surface":"白曜","kind":"person","person_id":"bm0_pqc_ydf","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0300","start":300,"end":302,"surface":"虞舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0307","start":307,"end":309,"surface":"姬文","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"據本段發言、親屬或任事語境辨識。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-024-cuidaogu:p004:m0341","start":341,"end":343,"surface":"景徽","kind":"person","person_id":"23q_wcp_hny_B","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"兩史同述道固之子、所襲臨淄爵、平州刺史、諡定及子休纂。其與《宋書》赴安都者的同指待核。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":2021236,"raw_start":11606,"raw_end":12029,"first_line":213,"last_line":213,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_character_offsets":[11606,11607,11608,11609,11610,11611,11612,11613,11614,11615,11616,11617,11618,11619,11620,11621,11622,11623,11624,11625,11626,11627,11628,11629,11630,11631,11632,11633,11634,11635,11636,11637,11638,11639,11640,11641,11642,11643,11644,11645,11646,11647,11648,11649,11650,11651,11652,11653,11654,11655,11656,11657,11658,11659,11660,11661,11662,11663,11664,11665,11666,11667,11668,11669,11670,11671,11672,11673,11674,11675,11676,11677,11678,11679,11680,11681,11682,11683,11684,11685,11686,11687,11688,11689,11690,11691,11692,11693,11694,11695,11696,11697,11698,11699,11700,11701,11702,11703,11704,11705,11706,11707,11708,11709,11710,11711,11712,11713,11714,11715,11716,11717,11718,11719,11720,11721,11722,11723,11724,11725,11726,11727,11728,11729,11730,11731,11732,11733,11734,11735,11736,11737,11738,11739,11740,11741,11742,11743,11744,11745,11746,11747,11748,11749,11750,11751,11752,11753,11754,11755,11756,11757,11758,11759,11760,11761,11